{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0493_1000_p", "source_sha256": "cc56385916f524e503ace5d2c6c89bb8ba0b76be5285f6e652b5526335658ad9", "ja": "（今日は昴のコスプレグラビア企画の撮影。\n可愛くて元気なキツネの姿を撮ることが狙いだ）", "zh": "（今天是昴的角色扮演写真企划拍摄。目标是拍出她可爱又有活力的狐狸模样）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0493_1001_047sub", "source_sha256": "c5bcdfcfdc186e5d71e7b7790e73b868a00e6df599044cf896a80ab6894586a6", "ja": "なぁ、{$P$}。\nこの衣装、ほんとーにオレに似合ってる？", "zh": "喂，{$P$}。\n这身衣服真的很适合我吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0493_1002_p", "source_sha256": "eab8e909ba70432233a7cd1a3931903e764947b18c89a6171e422b706d4f2a17", "ja": "ん？　もちろんだよ。\n……何か気になることでもあるのか？", "zh": "嗯？当然合适啊。\n……是有什么在意的事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0493_1003_047sub", "source_sha256": "599a112dfa36626ed299dcb734e34f705ebb60ca47d0056d167d3227bfc66b33", "ja": "いや。キツネの衣装って珍しいなと思ってさ。\n動物って、他にもいろんなのがいるじゃん？", "zh": "不是。我只是觉得狐狸的服装挺少见的。\n动物不是还有很多其他种类嘛？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0493_1004_p", "source_sha256": "aaaf48b98c4f6cae64cd35df55487c1789bee2209c8dd7dd1807c99021ca8415", "ja": "そうだな。犬や猫……ウサギも定番かな。だから\n変化球としてヒョウやキツネを取り入れてみたんだ。", "zh": "嗯，是啊。狗和猫……兔子也算经典吧。所以作为变化球，我尝试加入了豹子和狐狸。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0493_1005_047sub", "source_sha256": "86b400e52d1461fbc1f9344a091ba62b6e38c6058e571ce001c88481594eef30", "ja": "確かに。普通の球種じゃ物足りないもんな！\nよーし、オレも人になったキツネって感じで頑張るよ！", "zh": "说得对。普通的套路确实不够劲！\n好，我也要以\"化身人形的狐狸\"那种感觉来拼了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0493_1006_p", "source_sha256": "0d3306dc46b40e47d408c32564c40399e2d767ca96b08132a410d51122f70cfc", "ja": "人になったキツネか……。\nなんだかお稲荷さんみたいだな。", "zh": "变成人的狐狸啊……总觉得有点像稻荷神呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0493_1007_047sub", "source_sha256": "802fc3403a10cb4f7b8a8b14232217c49a674cc28924d1186968391375f90550", "ja": "……お稲荷さんって、神様のだよな？　えー……\n{$P$}、漫画の読みすぎじゃない？", "zh": "……你说的稻荷，是指神明的那个吧？呃——\n{$P$}，你是不是漫画看太多了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0493_1008_047sub", "source_sha256": "f4af79ddc5e52c4c4febdf0026c9efcb54ad76248c4d75201c70c2a2ee2f91bc", "ja": "オレ的には、やっぱ料理の方のおいなりさんかなー。\nていうか、考えてたらおなか空いてきたぁ……。", "zh": "对我来说，果然还是料理的油豆腐更好吧——\n话说，想着想着肚子都饿了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0493_1009_p", "source_sha256": "f05b5b5439db82fb114bed3ce2edfee396f591441457688d20be2d4398067b0d", "ja": "ははっ。\n昴の家は家族も多いし、たくさん食べそうだな。", "zh": "哈哈。昴家里人也多，应该能吃很多吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0493_1010_047sub", "source_sha256": "759f47548324723d968c574b0192e0e12fea0bb93268dbdbf5dfbed8ddbfa123", "ja": "そうだよ！　母さんと一緒にたくさん作って、\nおっきなお皿に山盛りにするんだ。", "zh": "就是啊！我会和妈妈一起做很多，然后把它们堆满在大盘子里。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0493_1011_047sub", "source_sha256": "966e0a64f4e44951cf1e468fb3ded26522a2cbf53813bd0049c342bc4787334d", "ja": "でも兄ちゃん達は、何も考えずにバクバク食べてさ\n……。用意するの、すっげー大変なんだぜ？", "zh": "可是哥哥们什么都不想，就一个劲儿地大吃……准备起来可辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0493_1012_p", "source_sha256": "55f2b0eb6df9c943a652c6109d9929a271e23a6d1f9340887bd1f0070dc4524f", "ja": "あ、あははは……。", "zh": "啊、啊哈哈哈……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0493_1013_047sub", "source_sha256": "f975c49ec5370b707be7ba09525471a525cc50ee9994ecbc0c76cd7cfde5398a", "ja": "笑いごとじゃないよ、{$P$}！\n時間かけて作ったのに、あっという間に消えるんだぜ？", "zh": "这可不是笑话啊，{$P$}！\n明明花了那么长时间才做好的，结果一下子就没了，不是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0493_1014_p", "source_sha256": "d6965afebbf34ff92fd6bf1b7e255d5160a8d734262b385d714c703daef743a6", "ja": "まあまあ……。たくさん食べたいくらい\n美味しかったってことじゃないかな！", "zh": "好啦好啦……这不就说明好吃到让人想多吃点嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0493_1015_047sub", "source_sha256": "49ed5f42f5f83cdaa80eacf27c07984b0b672ef7fe6caf89446406130f3db454", "ja": "……そっか。そういうことなら……まあ。\nなんかオレも食べたくなったし、久々に作ろうかな。", "zh": "……这样啊。既然是这样的话……倒也行吧。\n搞得我也想吃了，改天久违地做一次好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0493_1016_p", "source_sha256": "fbb3c560108b298ebc5c459a6284eadb659f85cbca5b7cbb69b9bf4125aa7c38", "ja": "ああ、いいと思うよ。今日の撮影を話題にしたら\nみんな喜んでくれるんじゃないか？", "zh": "嗯，我觉得挺好的。要是把今天拍摄的事当作话题，大家应该都会很开心吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0493_1017_047sub", "source_sha256": "bace51742322f53f22c0dad746b0137dcadff9867a8122750fec4f592c324e7c", "ja": "へへっ、そうだな♪\nバッチリ決めて、兄ちゃん達に自慢してやろーっと！", "zh": "嘿嘿，说得也是♪  \n我要好好表现一番，然后向哥哥们炫耀一番！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0493_1018_p", "source_sha256": "af086e96ab8baa2c18ae360c028fe9f56cd0bf9fbeac766c8a16309f22fd4c8a", "ja": "（昴のおかげで、撮影は無事終了。その後、山盛りの\nいなり寿司の写真が昴から届いた。……ぐぅ～）", "zh": "（多亏了昴，拍摄顺利结束了。之后，昴还发来了满满一大盘稻荷寿司的照片。……咕噜噜～）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
